  "created": "2026-11-27T20:37:28.95Z",
  "description": "HiQPdf Next Word to PDF Converter for .NET (Linux x64) is a component of the HiQPdf Next Library for .NET that enables accurate conversion of complex Word documents to PDF and to Markdown.\n\nThe converter targets .NET Standard 2.0 and can be used in .NET Core and .NET Framework applications deployed on Windows, Linux and macOS, including Azure, AWS, Google Cloud, Docker and Kubernetes.\n\nThis package installs only the Linux x64 runtime. For Linux ARM64, the additional package HiQPdf.Next.WordToPdf.Linux.Arm64 can be referenced on its own or alongside this package.\n\nSeparate packages are available for Windows, macOS or multi-platform runtimes.\n\nCompatibility:\n\n* Linux (x64) - Debian 11+, Ubuntu 20.04+ or equivalent\n* .NET 11.0, 10.0, 9.0, 8.0, 7.0, 6.0 and .NET Standard 2.0\n* Azure, AWS and Google Cloud for Linux\n* Linux Virtual Machines\n* Docker containers and Kubernetes for Linux\n* Web, Console and Desktop applications\n\nMain Features:\n\n* Convert Word DOCX documents to PDF and to Markdown\n* Use the PDF page settings from the original Word document\n* Use custom PDF page settings to automatically reflow the content\n* Automatically create a table of contents based on headings in Word\n* Use the page break marks from Word\n* Convert password protected documents\n* Generate PDF/A and PDF/UA documents\n* Add HTML headers, footers or stamps to the generated PDF\n* Control the PDF document display with PDF viewer preferences\n* Encrypt, set permissions and set passwords for the generated PDF documents\n* Add digital signatures to the generated PDF document\n* Asynchronous methods for async and await\n\nDocumentation and code samples:\nhttps://www.hiqpdf.com/hiqpdf-next-word-docx-to-pdf-dotnet",
